WEBVTT

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:12.900
Henriette-san!

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:19.790
Arsène-sama!

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:41.970
Has Arsène-sama abandoned us?

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:45.520
If you defeat me, I'll take back my words.

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:46.600
Only if you can.

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:55.570
We'll stop Arsène-sama even if it takes our lives.

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:57.070
We just need to defeat her.

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:11.130
I'm not beautiful.

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:14.720
My current self isn't beautiful.

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:17.720
That cloud looks like Arsène-sama!

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:26.810
Arsène-sama! Arsène-sama! Arsène-sama! Arsène-sama!

00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:30.860
Henriette-san!

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:33.820
Where are you!? Please answer us~!

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:37.990
Henriette-san!

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:40.950
I can't even lift it up by a bit.

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:42.910
Ah! Found her!

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:44.290
Where!?

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:47.210
Huh?

00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:49.790
How can you mistake a camel for her?

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:51.920
'Cause those things went "boing-boing".

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:56.340
This is?

00:01:57.800 --> 00:01:59.090
A treasure chest!?

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:05.350
We don't know what's in it, so we shouldn't open it.

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:06.270
It's fine!

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:07.890
I'll just open it myself.

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:13.190
Who's this person?

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:16.190
A person who loves to cosplay historical stuff?

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:18.450
I don't think so.

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:20.820
Is he a poor extra?

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:22.780
Hey, are you the ones who opened it!?

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:24.870
I know I was poor!

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:26.450
Are you saying I did it on purpose!?

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:28.180
Ouch...

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:30.290
Hey, Nero! Why did you knock into me suddenly?

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:32.210
Don't come here!

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:34.250
Go over to Cordelia instead!

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:39.180
Who's this raging person!?

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:42.220
He got even angrier!

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:43.430
Why!?

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:45.140
Someone help us!

00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:00.030
Thanks. You saved us, Abe-kun.

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:04.030
I hear that there are various Toys buried around here.

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:07.700
So, don't do anything reckless.

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:11.040
I thought I was going to drown.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:13.170
I drowned, though.

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:17.420
The Phantom Thief Empire has become so useless.

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:19.260
Don't say that we're useless!

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:24.010
We're neither useless nor pitiable!

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:26.180
Didn't Arséne abandon you!?

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:29.390
No way we are useless, pitiable or abandoned!

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:35.400
I haven't been abandoned before, so tell me how you feel!

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:40.280
Tell me! Tell me how do you feel about it!

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:43.320
She's really rubbing salt on their wounds.

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:44.530
A devil.

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:47.160
Evidence that she has an eccentric personality.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:50.160
So, how does it feel, Phantom Thief Empire?

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:53.120
Oh, or I should say Phantom Thief Town!?

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:53.960
What did you say!?

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:56.500
Or even Phantom Thief Village!?

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:00.920
Wait... How about "Field"?

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:13.770
Prepare yourselves!

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:17.360
What an extraordinary response.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:19.780
They didn't even want to defend themselves.

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:22.610
They have been stabbed in the heart by Kokoro, just like her name.

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:25.070
A pun?

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:26.120
Just a coincidence.

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:27.530
Interesting.

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:29.740
A coincidence is just a coincidence!

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:31.910
Off we go!

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:34.210
You have the right to remain silent.

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:38.920
But, your testimony may be used as evidence in court.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:40.670
An empire in name only now.

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:46.180
Arsène may have gone somewhere else, but we've caught the Three Cards!

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:50.010
As expected of the guardian deity of Yokohama, G4 which is led by Akechi Kokoro,

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:55.810
the beautiful genius girl with an IQ of 1,400,000,000,000,000, and skipped grades and graduated from Harvard University!

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:58.270
Kokoro's been taking up all the screentime recently!

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:04.320
No more...

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:06.740
I'm famished.

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:16.790
That's...

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:24.210
Henriette-san!

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:26.970
Nobody summoned you!

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:28.760
We know you've got lots of free time! Stop pretending!

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:30.350
You're so cruel, oink.

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:33.850
Even though I have something to deliver to you, oink.

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:35.350
A delivery!?

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:41.770
School closure confirmed?

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:43.650
What's "school closure"?

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:44.990
Dunno...

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:47.650
It just means the school will close down, oink.

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:48.860
Ah! That's right.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:51.660
No need for you to say it out loud.

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:52.870
Okay, okay, oink...

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:57.460
Oh, so it's just that the Detective Holmes Academy will close down.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:02.750
W-What does this mean!?

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:06.510
If the school is going to close down, what will happen to us?

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:08.970
Oh no. Oh no...

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:11.300
Show us some remorse, you culprit!

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:16.270
You're so mean. I brought even more things to deliver to you, oink.

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:17.940
Oh? What did you bring?

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:20.400
This is from the Student Council President, oink.

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:22.170
From the President?

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:23.230
She's fine!?

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:23.980
What's it say?

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:27.780
Eh? That's it?

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:30.910
No way! What's going to happen!?

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:33.580
Oh no. Oh no.

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:35.160
I still got more, oink.

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:39.330
What? If you had more, then bring them out right away, you devil!

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:40.370
Akita-san.

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:41.630
Abe-san.

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:45.130
Transfer papers from Detective Holmes Academy?

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:47.670
I'm transferred to Detective Marble Academy.

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.590
Mine's to Detective Wolf Academy.

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:52.090
I'm going to Detective Blue Moon Academy, huh?

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:54.850
Everybody's going to another academy?

00:06:54.850 --> 00:07:01.100
The Student Council President took measures so that we can continue our detective education...

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:03.480
Mine's in England! I wanted to go there so much!

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:06.020
America! I can't wait!

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:09.360
Everyone, you have to become a top-class detective!

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:12.490
We'll work together someday and solve cases!

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:15.370
Bye!

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:16.620
See you later!

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:18.160
How about us?

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:19.460
What will happen to us?

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:21.830
I got this letter for Milky Holmes, oink.

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:26.130
You got one! If you had one, then bring it out immediately! Learn that, dumbass!

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:28.260
What's written in it?

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:31.010
A blank.

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.180
What does that mean!?

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:33.510
I don't know, oink.

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:40.180
That's all. I need to deliver these transfer papers to those students who left immediately at the start of the summer holidays, oink.

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:42.440
Specially-made Lard!

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:48.900
Refuel complete, oink!

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:51.530
Well then, goodbye girls, oink.

00:07:53.610 --> 00:08:00.660
Even though Kamakura Big Detective is destroyed, the Detective Festival will go on as scheduled!

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:05.960
Also, it's decided that the pavilion will be constructed somewhere else!

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:08.670
So this place is just going to be a wasteland!

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:13.470
This means...

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:15.510
...we're abandoned, huh?

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:18.010
No way!

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:22.020
Why? Why did this happen?

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:25.310
Grandfather!

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:32.400
I heard that the Detective Holmes Academy is abandoned!

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:37.740
The embarrassment of the world has disappeared, so Yokohama will now be in peace!

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:40.370
It's the Age of the Police!

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:42.120
So it was abandoned.

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:44.620
What will Milky Holmes do?

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:47.250
Live like normal girls?

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:48.630
What constitutes "normal"?

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:49.670
No idea.

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:52.590
I sympathize with them a little.

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:54.510
You can fall to the bottom of the bottom!

00:08:56.590 --> 00:09:00.140
Kokoro-san is really the bottom of all humans, right?

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:01.680
Agreed.

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:04.980
We've fallen to the bottom, huh?

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:10.150
Without Arsène-sama, we're just cowards.

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:12.940
Arsène-sama!

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:14.570
I miss you!

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:17.780
I want to see you!

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:19.490
That wall isn't Arsène-sama!

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:23.830
Arsène-sama! Arsène-sama... Arsène-sama...

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:25.750
Arsène-sama!

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:27.960
This bounciness is so nostalgic.

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:28.830
What the hell?

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:30.670
You too!?

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:34.260
Don't lose grasp of reality!

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:37.930
Open your eyes, bastard!

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:40.890
I understand your feelings well.

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:44.520
Phantom Thieves must never escape from reality!

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:46.980
Stone River...

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.360
Isn't Arsène-sama in our hearts?

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:52.900
Arsène-sama!

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:55.690
You're the one who's detached from reality!

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:56.570
Right!

00:09:57.900 --> 00:10:00.120
Wake up!

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:06.580
What I just did... will only be forgiven with my decapitation!

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:08.420
Not!

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:11.880
Then, tell me how I can cure this splintering heart!?

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:14.550
My TKB is going papayas!

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:17.670
What must I do to cure it?

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:19.640
Don't we already know?

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:22.100
It's Milky Holmes.

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:27.680
Because of them, Arsène-sama is stressed and that's why she did all of these things.

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:29.060
I'm up for it!

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:31.560
Our situation is so terrible.

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:35.320
It's their fault, so we'll take revenge and go all out to defeat them!

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:36.650
I ain't got no time to waste!

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:39.610
Jailbreak!

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:47.790
L'Aiguille Creuse

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:53.000
This place was Henriette-san's house.

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:00.680
This is...

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:09.560
Everything is gone.

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:12.230
Our field... Our school...

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:14.230
The attic too...

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:15.940
Don't give up!

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:17.650
We have our dream-

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:19.650
There are impossible dreams.

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:20.610
Nero!

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:21.530
Am I not right!?

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:24.370
We worked so hard and got only 300 yen.

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:26.410
We did Foreign Exchange and escorting.

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:28.290
It was all for nothing.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:31.500
We earned them all from my part time jobs...

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:35.130
Even you, Sher! You didn't manage to lay a finger on Arsène, right!?

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:36.630
What "dream" do we have!?

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:38.460
Our Toys won't come back either!

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:39.760
Nero...

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:42.260
It's all over.

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:47.680
It's like she's taken on the Greek national debt.

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:55.020
Henriette-san.

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:59.440
Please tell us what to do.

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:02.740
Oh my, Student Council President Henriette.

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:05.530
You're going to extend the time?

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:07.990
I can eat anything I want.

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:09.870
Thank you!

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:12.910
Look! Our Toys have returned!

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:16.750
Cordelia-san, wake up!

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.710
Henriette-san isn't here!

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:20.380
She is~!

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:22.590
Look, she's over here~.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:34.390
Henriette-san!

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:47.660
There they are.

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:49.790
If we can re-spark their lives...

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:52.160
I won't let them get away with it!

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:56.040
Phantom Thief Empire is here!

00:12:58.630 --> 00:12:59.500
Don't ignore us!

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:02.460
Sherlock, I'm going to blow your hair into bits!

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:05.090
Nero, I'm going to snatch away your hat!

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:08.720
Cordelia, I'm going to ruffle your hair!

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:12.850
Hercule, wanna have your detective clothes become a mini-skirt!?

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:15.640
Why!?

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:17.230
Why aren't they responding!?

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:20.730
What's with their faces?

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:24.790
Wake up now!

00:13:24.790 --> 00:13:29.120
Ah, those flowers suit you, Henriette-san.

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:31.240
Something's weird about her.

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:34.330
A Toys? No...

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:37.330
Escaping from reality?

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:40.630
Wake up! Don't escape from reality!

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:42.300
Henriette-sama isn't here!

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:45.760
Oh yes she is. Over there.

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:50.720
That's not her!

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:01.060
Where are we?

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:12.780
Arsène-sama!

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:16.620
*rub*

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:20.420
Oh, our flower garden... Oh, our flower garden...

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:22.630
Our happiness...

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:25.590
Oh, our flower garden... Oh, our flower garden...

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:27.220
She's so beautiful.

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:29.050
She has a goddess-like smile.

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:33.010
Henriette-sama didn't abandon us!

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:35.560
I'm so happy.

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:44.900
I'm so happy!

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:48.610
Let's have a fun time making flowerbands.

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:51.740
Heriette-sama, it's almost done.

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:55.330
What's this twitching pain?

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:58.750
Heriette-sama, I'm almost done with mine.

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:04.540
I'm supposed to be happy, but my heart ruffles.

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:05.460
What is the reason?

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:13.550
Don't tell me that wasn't reality?

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:18.180
What's this?

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:20.770
Free us!

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:23.610
Free us from this illusion!

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:31.400
Come with me!

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:38.450
Look at them!

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:43.120
They are escaping reality...

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:43.920
That's right.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:48.170
All right.

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:54.430
You all have lost everything.

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:57.430
So have we.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:15:59.470
Henri―

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:02.100
Arsène-sama left us behind.

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:03.770
She was our everything.

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:07.320
We are at the bottom of despair.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:10.610
But we will not escape reality!

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:14.570
Running away from reality is the easy way out.

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:17.450
Arsène-sama wouldn't wish us to take that path!

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:18.950
What about Henriette-sama?

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:24.120
Would she wish that you run away when you're having a hard time!?

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:25.580
Umm...

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:27.040
What would she wish!?

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:28.710
Err... Umm...

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:36.340
No! Don't come close to me!

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:48.570
I got you!

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:55.450
Eat this!

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:10.670
Huh? Where are we?

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:12.590
Have you gotten your senses back!?

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:14.630
Why do people fall down?

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:16.010
Because there is a lake?

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:17.760
People fall to achieve greater heights!

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:21.970
The lion king threw his cub down the bottomless ravine.

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:23.390
Why did he do that?

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:26.020
Umm... To allow his cub to achieve greater heights?

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:30.070
Correct.

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:31.440
Woohoo.

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:35.780
In short, Henriette-sama ― Arsène-sama is the lion king.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:37.450
And we are the cubs.

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:42.540
We have to become splendid phantom thieves.

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:43.540
And for you all.

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:46.120
...to become splendid detectives?

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:46.790
Yes.

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:49.750
We'll become splendid detectives!

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:52.340
Now rise!

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:54.630
The cubs of the lion king now roar your spirits!

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:56.930
It might be this big.

00:17:56.930 --> 00:18:03.890
With it, we'll be able to achieve anything and aim for our future!

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:08.480
We might be dimwitted, but we shall not fall anymore!

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:11.360
Now, take my hands!

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:13.940
Thank you, Herc-san.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:15.240
W-Why!?

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:16.900
Why won't you take my hand!?

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:27.660
Please become splendid phantom thieves, Stone River-san, Twenty-san, Lioness-san!

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:28.960
What are you saying!?

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:30.290
It's Rat!

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:33.170
And you become splendid detectives too!

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:36.760
And catch us if you think you can!

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:39.470
Our situations differ, but...

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:41.760
...we shall both do our best!

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:44.140
Why? Why wouldn't you look at me!?

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:45.470
Well then, bye!

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:46.520
Yeah!

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:49.520
To each and everyone of our futures!

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:52.810
Hey, wait up!

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:54.650
Stop ignoring me all the time!

00:19:04.990 --> 00:19:06.410
What are you writing?

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:07.540
Our future.

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:08.450
Huh?

00:19:08.450 --> 00:19:11.620
Our future is as white as the paper we received from Henriette-san.

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:13.330
That's why I'm writing on it.

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:14.290
Here!

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:16.550
Neo Detective Holmes Academy?

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:19.670
This is our future.

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:21.220
Isn't it just great?

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:23.510
Now's the start of the new semester.

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:24.800
Let's have our lessons!

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:26.260
Yeah!

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:28.220
We'll become splendid detectives.

00:19:28.220 --> 00:19:30.640
The deadline is the day of the Detective World Fair.

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:32.440
Only four months left.

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:36.190
I'll do my best too!

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:40.360
Milky Holmes + Kamaboko + Arty!

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:42.990
Let's go!

00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:06.640
Goodbye, Milky Holmes.

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:09.310
Forever.
